# Files copied into every Claude Code worktree created with `claude --worktree`.
#
# Syntax is the same as .gitignore. Claude only copies files that BOTH match a
# pattern here AND are gitignored — tracked files (e.g. .env.example) are never
# duplicated. This guarantees a fresh worktree starts with the secret keys the
# app needs (Supabase, AI proxy) instead of the "supabaseUrl is required" blank
# screen. The matching git-based helper in scripts/worktree.ps1 copies the same
# list.
.env
.env.local
.env.test
